# Moomoo API

When the user asks about Moomoo quotes, orders, OpenD, options, crypto via Moomoo, or `moomoo-api`, follow the project skill at:

`.cursor/skills/moomooapi/SKILL.md`

Scripts and docs live under `.cursor/skills/moomooapi/scripts/` and `.cursor/skills/moomooapi/docs/`.

Defaults: paper trading (`TrdEnv.SIMULATE`); OpenD at `127.0.0.1:11111`. For OpenD install/upgrade, use `.cursor/skills/install-moomoo-opend/SKILL.md`.
